    "order": 98,
    "anchor": "14-determine-victor-2",
    "summary": "A team whose armies are painted Battle Ready scores 10VP. When the battle ends, the team with more VP wins; equal VP is a draw. VP beyond these caps are ignored:\n\n- **PRIMARY MISSION**: at most 15VP per battle round, 45VP in all\n- **SECONDARY MISSIONS**: at most 15VP per battle round, 45VP in all, and 20VP from each Fixed Secondary Mission card\n- **BATTLE READY ARMY**: 10VP",
